{"4948200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Sector: Rogue", "steam_appid": 4948200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced FPS Roguelite:</strong> Fight through intense arena battles where every run plays out differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras/00c864fa8d9cc5cac8724e30f07419fe.avif?t=1787321562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras_big/00c864fa8d9cc5cac8724e30f07419fe.avif?t=1787321562 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose or Create Your Playstyle:</strong> Start with one of several class archetypes, then customize active abilities, passive bonuses, mobility skills, and ultimates to create a build of your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Retro-Futuristic Setting:</strong> Explore atmospheric environments filled with dangerous enemies and mysterious locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras/978018c495bbfc5931619aa387930888.avif?t=1787321562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras_big/978018c495bbfc5931619aa387930888.avif?t=1787321562 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Powerful Combinations:</strong> Combine weapons, perks, and abilities to create unique synergies and discover devastating builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Arsenal of Weapons:</strong> Master a diverse range of firearms, from classic pistols and shotguns to experimental energy weapons and devastating heavy armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Battles:</strong> Face unique bosses with varied attacks, deadly mechanics, and ever-increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Movement Combat:</strong> Use dashes, double jumps, grappling hooks, and advanced movement techniques to outmaneuver your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras/8790dc169ef9b26de22ebe6a4dec0953.avif?t=1787321562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras_big/8790dc169ef9b26de22ebe6a4dec0953.avif?t=1787321562 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression &amp; Replayability:</strong> Unlock new abilities, upgrades, and options between runs as you explore different paths, builds, and difficulty levels.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced FPS Roguelite:</strong> Fight through intense arena battles where every run plays out differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras/00c864fa8d9cc5cac8724e30f07419fe.avif?t=1787321562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948200/extras_big/00c864fa8d9cc5cac8724e30f07419fe.avif?t=1787321562 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose or Create Your Playstyle:</strong> Start with one of several class archetypes, then customize active abilities, passive bonuses, mobility skills, and ultimates to create a build of your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive Retro-Futuristic Setting:</strong> Explore atmospheric environments filled with dangerous enemies and mysteri